# Proof texts {#sec:proofs}

We are the Lord's (@{bible:romanos#14:8}), as the catechism's first answer
says (@{reformed:confessions/reformed/heidelberg#sec:q1}), while a bare
@sec:proofs is still a local cross-reference. A short form
@{reformed:heidelberg#sec:q1..sec:q3} and a malformed @{Not A Ref} are both
kept exactly as written; a literal @\{not:a-ref} stays prose.

!quote bible:romanos#14:8-9

